#! `shutdown` answers `null` and `exit` terminates. A second request after
#! `shutdown` must be refused with InvalidRequest rather than served, because
#! a server that keeps working after shutdown is a server an editor cannot
#! close. The process exit is asserted by the driver, not by a record.
name      lifecycle/shutdown-exit-clean
profile   minimal

initialize
open      hello.lu
wait      diagnostics hello.lu
shutdown-only
req       hover hello.lu 8:7
exit
